{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_08_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2d6ef78177ee9491c50846307bd95393888dd4e7e64de98ddbf62cbb4a0bab31",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ce8fff22bba1a368b360668d9407a0e4cfa4360b66c9d5fd5344de03950bd0",
      "text": "……可恶，搞什么“力量微笑LIVE”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6b329bb43d212620b005d0aa66f2898f4083c54ef26f95dd59f97b1cc2beac",
      "text": "（我虽然说过别什么都问我、由现场定夺，\n但可没说连那种事都能自作主张啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b251efcc49e9bcead8ebb58fdb1b6322a8c034558800722d769e5a228d90658",
      "text": "……男极联赛本来就是为了让大家明白\n我的事务所才是第一，才特意举办的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fdecb5cd367b73d01431e303e93a759e60d177a24c9e1d8c203510495700b6e",
      "text": "运动会给竞争对手们发了错误的规则……\n之后也持续进行各种各样的妨碍……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5936ac6e876d082f978c01505a3593df9320b344fdeb0f902278fa5e5e239d0",
      "text": "最近更是无视工作人员打乱现场节奏……！\n这次明明都逼得他们取消舞台了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad1b3d189eb02a55c117029aa569ff45b3abdf3ceb022f947714e9f8207e41b",
      "text": "那个不知哪来的事务所每次都擅自行动，\n搞得声势浩大！我的盘算全落空了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d91a95aa22e0583b943312a11eef8830231a03708522fd65d5824f17738ba20e",
      "text": "（哼！果然这种大会还是趁早\n切割、撤退才是上策……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed4b2e228eb2ae97beffef248310db309351015bf7d51d3b1af62e572ef4dba",
      "text": "虽然男极联赛已临近尾声……\n但各位都太优秀了，实在是选不出KING！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5ddcd96246b64f1fda570264310e4a804ea0e4d6c41eced917b0de728b547b1",
      "text": "因此，这样如何？给至今为止表现尤为突出的\n前5名事务所，颁发优秀奖。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9162894e4d4a6b91188b9c71d6534c2e2c8410b01b2272ca88ad9a725423719d",
      "text": "这样一来，就能让超出预期的更多偶像、事务所，\n以及粉丝们都皆大欢喜了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_j:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8b8d9ca26f1fce76a55501fe18c8eaa2585880eb8eaa6aab5ac168c13859788",
      "text": "（呵呵呵……这样的话，\n就绝不会有我们以外的人拿到KING了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
